WEBVTT

00:06:56.246 --> 00:07:00.704
things that I that I never witnessed
beyond that, you know, as an adult.

00:07:00.746 --> 00:07:05.288
I mean, I saw as a little child my
first some of the first things

00:07:05.288 --> 00:07:09.746
I saw were really, you know, my mother
being beaten by my father,

00:07:09.954 --> 00:07:12.746
my mother almost being
killed before my eyes

00:07:12.746 --> 00:07:15.746
and my father my mother being
raped by my father.

00:07:15.746 --> 00:07:21.079
And so my memory, my perception of
what I understood in those years.

00:07:22.121 --> 00:07:29.413
It's definitely one of fear and and
sorrow and terror and darkness.